What XP level to be at before descending is an open question.
it depends on your experience, playing style, and how deep
you already are.  I like to be at XP=2 before I descend to
explore level 2 (but I go down the stairs as soon as I find them
then come back up).  I like to be at XP=3 before I descend to
explore level 3.  Well before level 10 this pattern no longer makes
sense, though.  later in the game many even think it is a good
idea to avoid leveling up any more than is needed to get into the
Quest.



